Home
</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-gray-400">/</span><a href="/home/overview" class="text-foreground-muted hover:text-primary">Overview</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-gray-400">/</span><span class="text-foreground font-medium">Chain Coverage</span></li></ol></nav> <div class="mb-8 h-1 w-full rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-primary via-primary/50 to-transparent"></div> <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-foreground mb-6">Chain Coverage</h1> <article class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">  <p>Numia provides indexed data and infrastructure across 40+ blockchain networks, with deep specialization in the Cosmos ecosystem.</p>
<h2 id="coverage-summary">Coverage Summary</h2>








































<table><thead><tr><th>Ecosystem</th><th>Chains</th><th>Data Warehouse</th><th>Node Services</th><th>APIs</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Cosmos</strong></td><td>40+</td><td>Yes</td><td>Yes</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ethereum</strong></td><td>Mainnet + L2s</td><td>Yes</td><td>Limited</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Solana</strong></td><td>Mainnet</td><td>Yes</td><td>Limited</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bitcoin</strong></td><td>Mainnet</td><td>Yes</td><td>No</td><td>Limited</td></tr></tbody></table>
<hr/>
<h2 id="cosmos-ecosystem">Cosmos Ecosystem</h2>
<p>Our deepest coverage is in the Cosmos ecosystem, where we index 40+ chains with full historical data.</p>
<h3 id="major-cosmos-chains">Major Cosmos Chains</h3>


















































































<table><thead><tr><th>Chain</th><th>Data Warehouse</th><th>APIs</th><th>Lenses</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Osmosis</strong></td><td>Full</td><td>Full</td><td>Yes</td><td>DEX-specific tables</td></tr><tr><td><strong>dYdX</strong></td><td>Full</td><td>Full</td><td>Yes</td><td>Perpetuals data</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Celestia</strong></td><td>Full</td><td>Full</td><td>No</td><td>DA metrics</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Neutron</strong></td><td>Full</td><td>Full</td><td>No</td><td>Smart contracts</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Cosmos Hub</strong></td><td>Full</td><td>Yes</td><td>No</td><td>IBC data</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Injective</strong></td><td>Full</td><td>Yes</td><td>No</td><td>DeFi data</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Sei</strong></td><td>Full</td><td>Yes</td><td>No</td><td>Trading data</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Stargaze</strong></td><td>Full</td><td>Yes</td><td>No</td><td>NFT data</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Noble</strong></td><td>Full</td><td>Yes</td><td>No</td><td>Stablecoin data</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Stride</strong></td><td>Full</td><td>Yes</td><td>No</td><td>LST data</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h3 id="all-supported-cosmos-chains">All Supported Cosmos Chains</h3>
<details><summary>View full list (40+ chains)</summary>








































































































































<table><thead><tr><th>Chain</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Akash</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Archway</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Axelar</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Band Protocol</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Celestia</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Chihuahua</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Comdex</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Cosmos Hub</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Crescent</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Crypto.org</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>dYdX</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Evmos</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Injective</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Juno</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Kava</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Kujira</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Mars</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Migaloo</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Neutron</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Nillion</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Noble</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Osmosis</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Persistence</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Quicksilver</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Secret</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Sei</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Sommelier</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Stargaze</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Stride</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Terra</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td>Umee</td><td>Active</td></tr><tr><td><em>+ additional chains</em></td><td>Active</td></tr></tbody></table></details>
<hr/>
<h2 id="ethereum-ecosystem">Ethereum Ecosystem</h2>



































<table><thead><tr><th>Network</th><th>Data Warehouse</th><th>APIs</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ethereum Mainnet</td><td>Yes</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Arbitrum</td><td>Yes</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Optimism</td><td>Yes</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Base</td><td>Yes</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Polygon</td><td>Yes</td><td>Yes</td></tr></tbody></table>
<hr/>
<h2 id="other-networks">Other Networks</h2>






























<table><thead><tr><th>Network</th><th>Data Warehouse</th><th>APIs</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Solana</td><td>Yes</td><td>Limited</td></tr><tr><td>Bitcoin</td><td>Yes</td><td>Limited</td></tr><tr><td>Sui</td><td>Coming</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Aptos</td><td>Coming</td><td>No</td></tr></tbody></table>
<hr/>
<h2 id="data-availability-by-chain">Data Availability by Chain</h2>
<h3 id="whats-indexed">What’s Indexed</h3>
<p>For each supported chain, we typically provide:</p>

































<table><thead><tr><th>Data Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Blocks</strong></td><td>Block metadata, timestamps, validators</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Transactions</strong></td><td>Full transaction data, messages, events</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Transfers</strong></td><td>Token transfers with parsed amounts</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Staking</strong></td><td>Delegations, undelegations, rewards</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Governance</strong></td><td>Proposals, votes, deposits</td></tr><tr><td><strong>IBC</strong></td><td>Cross-chain transfers and packets</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h3 id="chain-specific-data">Chain-Specific Data</h3>
<p>Some chains have additional specialized tables:</p>

























<table><thead><tr><th>Chain</th><th>Special Data</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Osmosis</strong></td><td>Pool data, swaps, LP positions</td></tr><tr><td><strong>dYdX</strong></td><td>Perpetuals, funding rates, liquidations</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Stargaze</strong></td><td>NFT sales, collections, metadata</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Noble</strong></td><td>USDC mints, burns, flows</td></tr></tbody></table>
<hr/>
<h2 id="requesting-new-chains">Requesting New Chains</h2>
<p>We continuously expand chain coverage based on partner requirements.</p>
<p><strong>To request a new chain:</strong></p>
<ol>
<li>Contact us at <a href="mailto:support@numia.xyz">support@numia.xyz</a></li>
<li>Provide chain details and your use case</li>
<li>We’ll assess feasibility and timeline</li>
</ol>
<p>Priority is given to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Chains with existing partnership interest</li>
<li>Chains requested by multiple partners</li>
<li>Cosmos SDK chains (fastest to add)</li>
</ul>
<hr/>
